From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Eterna Forest's light finer than a pixel (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The clouds' light over Eterna Forest follows the camera from a place the
game keeps finer than a pixel, and sways slowly from side to side (a
table, a pixel every 8 frames); the BG's scroll register has it in whole
pixels, 1, 2 or 3 a step as the player walks. The 3DS remaster's
compositor draws that BG itself: the place is handed to it as it's kept
(NitroPort_SetBgFineScroll), the sway eased from one entry of the table
to the next, so it's drawn there and halfway between two in the
in-between frames.
---
  src/overlay005/ov5_021D5EB8.c | 16 ++++++++++++++++
  1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/overlay005/ov5_021D5EB8.c b/src/overlay005/ov5_021D5EB8.c
index 65595a1b..5dc5606d 100644
--- a/src/overlay005/ov5_021D5EB8.c
+++ b/src/overlay005/ov5_021D5EB8.c
@@ -5249,6 +5249,22 @@ static void ov5_021DB144(SysTask *param0, void *param1)
 
         Bg_ScheduleScroll(v0->unk_00->fieldSystem->bgConfig, 2, 0, (v1->unk_AC >> FX32_SHIFT) + v5);
         Bg_ScheduleScroll(v0->unk_00->fieldSystem->bgConfig, 2, 3, (v1->unk_B0 >> FX32_SHIFT));
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+        {
+            // (the 3DS remaster: the clouds' place finer than a pixel, as
+            // it's kept: drawn there, and halfway between two in the
+            // in-between frames, where the whole pixels went 1, 2 or 3 a
+            // step as the camera moved; their slow sway from side to side
+            // (the table, a pixel every 8 frames) eased from one entry to
+            // the next instead of a pixel's jump)
+            extern void NitroPort_SetBgFineScroll(int bg, s32 hofs, s32 vofs);
+            int entry = v1->unk_B4 / 8, part = v1->unk_B4 % 8;
+            s32 from = (s8)Unk_ov5_02201D38[entry], to = (s8)Unk_ov5_02201D38[(entry + 1) % 64];
+            s32 sway = from * FX32_ONE + (to - from) * FX32_ONE * part / 8;
+
+            NitroPort_SetBgFineScroll(2, v1->unk_AC + sway, v1->unk_B0);
+        }
+#endif
     }
 }
 
